  "abstract": "Covers the Rego policy language of Open Policy Agent at OPA v1.21.1: modules, packages and imports, every rule kind, the if, contains, in, every, some, not and with keywords, the opt-in and/or keywords and improved not semantics, comprehensions, verified built-ins, the input and data documents, opa test with mocking, opa check, strict mode, opa fmt and capabilities, bundles and signing, the /v1/data Data API, performance basics and deny-by-default authorization patterns. Rego v1 (OPA 1.x) is current, Rego v0 (OPA 0.x) is legacy with upgrade steps, and the unreleased import rego.v2 is tracked as a preview. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out versions, the language, authorization patterns, built-ins and OPA interfaces, and testing and tooling.",
